<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 25.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 25.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 25     June 24   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  271.880     271.900     247.020   10.06 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.350     309.140     306.830    0.82 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.900     157.715     158.970   -0.67 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.778	46.730	47.182   -0.86 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  453.220     454.200     419.180    8.12 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.315     140.165     141.685   -0.97 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.154	16.140	16.185   -0.19 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  238.880     237.170     212.430   12.45 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.871	 1.867	 1.888   -0.90 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.566	 1.563	 1.581   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  188.990     189.325     183.135    3.20 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
